Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:06.28,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,346)\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4140,5380)}Episode 5
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:06.28,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,525)\fade(255,0,255,0,1300,4140,5380)}Three Heroes Duel Lü Bu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:17.10,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the first month of the first year \Nof the Chuping era, 190 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:20.68,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,eighteen lords formed an coalition to help the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:22.27,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,swearing a blood oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.81,0:01:25.73,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,They elected Yuan Shao as the leader of the alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:29.69,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and declared war against Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:40.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(848,485.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1620,1980)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.44,0:02:01.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.667,493.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5500,5500)}Sūn Jiān\NStyled: Wéntái
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.96,0:02:09.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.333,496)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(953.333,498.667)}Gōngsūn Zàn\NStyled: Bóguī
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.28,0:02:28.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961.333,478.667)}Yuán Shù\NStyled: Gōnglù
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:32.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.333,485.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1780,2000)}Bào Xìn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:40.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Our Hàn Dynasty is in turmoil, its imperium lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.97,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The bastard Dǒng Zhuō exploits this unrest for his vices,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.74,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}degrading what's noble and harming the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:55.24,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}We, who fear for the spirits of the realm, \Nare gathered today in unity to save our nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:03:00.61,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Allied in purpose, together as one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:03.41,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Loyalty till the end, wills split by none!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:07.31,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Whoever betrays us shall be razed by the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:11.95,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,{\bord12}August gods, \Nancestral spirits, be our witness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:16.65,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Allied in purpose, together as one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:20.18,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Loyalty till the end, wills split by none!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:23.82,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Whoever betrays us shall be razed by the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:28.87,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I hereby order Sun Jian, Administrator\N of Changsha, as vanguard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.86,0:03:31.45,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He will march to Sishui Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:34.02,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,The main force shall march at dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.34,0:03:36.36,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Onward to Luoyang!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:59.24,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,An army of eighteen lords marches towards Luoyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.32,0:03:59.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320.333,504)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2380,2820)}Dǒng Zhuō\NStyled: Zhòngyǐng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.47,0:04:01.88,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,How will we deal with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.79,0:04:09.02,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Father, do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:15.48,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,Those lords outside are but rank grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:15.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(325.333,502.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2500,2840)}Lǚ Bù\NStyled: Fèngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:22.01,Default,Lü Bu,0,0,0,,I can lead our fiercest men and \Nhang their heads at the capital gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:30.12,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,With you, Fengxian, this old man can rest carefree!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.07,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.40,0:04:42.88,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Why kill chickens with an ox-cleaver?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:45.36,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,General Hua!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:46.64,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:51.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(970.667,468)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2000,2360)}Huà Xióng
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.39,0:04:51.34,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,No need to burden Lü Bu with this task!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:55.76,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,I can claim their heads as easily as picking a pocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:07.08,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,We are willing to follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:13.50,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:19.44,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,General Hua, you are now Colonel of Agile Cavalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:21.28,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Thank you, Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:26.43,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,The four of you, go to Sishui Pass to oppose the foe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:31.44,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Behead them all and you'll be greatly rewarded!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(252.8,499.2)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1620,1980)}Lǐ Sù
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.94,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Thank you, Premier!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.23,0:05:48.00,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:51.74,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Sun Jian is known as the Tiger of Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.40,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,The alliance leader named him as the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.55,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,If he gets top honors, we brothers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.13,0:06:00.56,Default,Bao Zhong,0,0,0,,Brother, do you mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.68,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,I will give you 3,000 troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.23,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Take a shortcut to Sishui Pass to strike them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.55,0:06:10.32,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,If you annihilate them, you would draw the honor of first-blood, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.333,494.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1600,1960)}Bào Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:11.18,Default,Bao Zhong,0,0,0,,Correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.74,Default,Bao Zhong,0,0,0,,I will win us the honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:13.83,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,That is what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.25,0:06:29.35,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:35.46,Default,Bao Zhong,0,0,0,,Report, Bao Zhong rushed to Sishui Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:39.36,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,He was beheaded by Hua Xiong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:42.19,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.38,0:06:51.92,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.39,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:00.04,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Cheers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:05.20,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,General Hua, victorious from your first battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:09.14,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Within one round and that Bao Zhong was left without a head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.55,0:07:14.40,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Perhaps he did not realise this even as he died!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:23.46,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,The eighteen lords are nothing but a motley gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:25.30,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.36,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.36,0:07:27.86,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Drink! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:28.26,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:32.74,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.74,0:07:34.48,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Bao Zhong's head was sent to the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.96,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,The Premier promoted you to Chief-Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:42.40,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Chief-Commander Hua!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:44.09,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Cheers, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.09,0:07:45.32,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.72,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Sun Jian is challenging you below the pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.90,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,After I finish this cup, I will deal with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:56.14,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:07:58.37,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.32,0:08:03.06,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Sun Jian has four valiant officers! \NDo not underestimate him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.53,0:08:04.40,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.65,0:08:06.43,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Hu Zhen was slain by Sun Jian!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.58,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,His fame really is warranted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:13.32,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.24,0:08:19.80,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Loose arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.78,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Do not panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.12,0:08:49.19,Default,General,0,0,0,,Report, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:52.21,Default,General,0,0,0,,We are winning and will soon capture Sishui Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:54.14,Default,General,0,0,0,,The wicked Hu Zhen was slain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:57.72,Default,General,0,0,0,,Capturing it is a matter of time, we only need the supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.43,Default,General,0,0,0,,We hope you will supply us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.80,0:09:07.04,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(333.333,442.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6980,7240)}Yuán Shù\NStyled: Gōnglù
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.13,0:09:03.02,Default,General,0,0,0,,We can then easily storm \NSishui Pass and kill Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.55,0:09:08.98,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Sun Jian truly is a talented general.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:12.42,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,He lives up to his fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:19.48,Default,General,0,0,0,,He holds your family in great esteem, so we hope you can supply us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.90,0:09:23.71,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Go back and inform General Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:27.04,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,that provisions will be issued on the day we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:28.97,Default,General,0,0,0,,Thank you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.70,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,No need for courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.70,0:09:36.16,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,We all have a duty to eliminate a traitor. I am only doing my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:37.24,Default,General,0,0,0,,Thank you, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.26,0:09:53.15,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,My lord, about the provisions...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:59.29,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Naturally, we should provide Sun Jian his lacking provisions...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.89,0:10:01.12,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Only that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:07.80,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Only that if Sun Jian storms Sishui Pass, \Nhe'd be hailed as a hero, eclipsing all others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.87,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Your worry is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.37,0:10:14.26,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,My lord, he is famed as the Tiger of Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.26,0:10:20.22,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,If he storms Sishui Pass and takes over Luoyang, he will kill Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.22,0:10:23.11,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,This is akin to replacing a wolf with a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.11,0:10:26.99,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,It would be better not to supply him\Nand let his forces disintegrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:30.28,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Would this not rid you of a potential rival?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.21,0:10:39.00,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.06,0:10:41.72,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.19,0:10:44.00,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:47.37,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Reports say Yuan Shu refused to supply Sun Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:50.20,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,Sūn Jiān's camp is in utter dissaray!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:55.57,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,As I expected, they are nothing but a motley gang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:11:00.24,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Yuan Shu fears Sun Jian will win top honors, so he didn't supply him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:03.37,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,With such squabbles, what use is their coalition?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.78,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,This is your chance to return home a great victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:10.22,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:12.98,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,In my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.98,0:11:16.12,Default,Li Su,0,0,0,,you can destroy Sun Jian tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.64,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Do not panic! Disobedience means death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.57,0:12:48.93,Default,Zu Mao,0,0,0,,My lord, please evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:51.24,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Where are you running?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:13.22,Default,Zu Mao,0,0,0,,My lord, your red plumed helmet is too distinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.33,Default,Zu Mao,0,0,0,,Switch with mine now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:17.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1018,526.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1420,1760)}Zǔ Mào
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.23,0:13:20.72,Default,Zu Mao,0,0,0,,Flee! I will rally our remaining troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.65,0:13:24.26,Default,Hua Xiong,0,0,0,,Kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.83,0:13:50.64,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I cannot believe Sun Jian lost to Hua Xiong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:58.19,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Two days ago, Bao Zhong \Nignored orders and attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:02.17,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,He lost his life and so did many other soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.69,0:14:05.43,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Today, Sun Jian was defeated by Hua Xiong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:08.72,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Our morale has suffered grievously!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:14.43,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Gentlemen. Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:16.70,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Why are you all keeping quiet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:35.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,505.333)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1780,2080)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.01,0:14:40.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Administrator Gongsun, who is that behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:45.26,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,Someone who grew up with me, Prefect Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.37,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,We both agreed to fight Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.95,0:14:55.50,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Is he the Liu Xuande who fought the Yellow Scarves?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:56.47,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,None other!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.88,0:15:00.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I have long admired your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.85,0:15:04.48,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,He is a descendant of Prince Jìng of Zhōngshān, of Emperor Jǐng!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:12.31,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You are a scion of the Han...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.39,0:15:14.26,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Bring a seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:23.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,I may not respect your rank, but I respect your imperial lineage instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:24.83,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.18,0:15:27.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Many thanks, leader, for the seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:34.44,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report! Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:35.94,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.94,0:15:39.17,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Hua Xiong has led heavy cavalry \Nhere with Sun Jian's helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.77,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,He demands a challenge from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,466.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1750,2080)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúnchǎng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:49.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who will go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.31,0:15:52.44,Default,Yu She,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.44,0:15:52.97,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.07,0:16:03.16,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:04.84,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,R-Report, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.84,0:16:08.38,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Yu She lasted three bouts against \NHua Xiong before being cut down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:09.80,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.12,Default,Han Fu,0,0,0,,Do not worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.12,0:16:21.55,Default,Han Fu,0,0,0,,My best general, Pan Feng, can behead Hua Xiong!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:23.50,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Great! Send General Pan out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:27.76,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(984,470.667)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1660,2000)}Pān Fèng
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.29,Default,Pan Feng,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.76,Default,Pan Feng,0,0,0,,Get me my weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.71,0:16:53.66,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Report, leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.28,Default,Reporter,0,0,0,,Hua Xiong also killed Pan Feng!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.52,0:17:28.81,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,A pity that my two best men, \NYan Liang and Wen Chou, are not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.35,0:17:32.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,If either one was, Hua Xiong would not be a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:40.48,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,I will behead Hua Xiong and bring back his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.10,0:17:46.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.49,0:17:53.30,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,He is sworn brother of Liu Xuande,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.84,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, styled Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.20,0:18:00.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,What is his rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.84,0:18:03.08,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,He is a mounted archer under Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.08,0:18:04.96,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,This is an insult, do we have no better men?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:10.25,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,A paltry mounted archer dares to crow such drivel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:13.24,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Guards, get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:17.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:22.52,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He dares to speak up, so he must be a valiant man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.52,0:18:24.06,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Let him fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:26.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If he loses, then we can reprimand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:31.64,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,If we let out a mere horse-archer, we will be mocked by Hua Xiong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,This man looks extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:37.05,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How could Hua Xiong know he is a mounted archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.56,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If I lose, my head is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.06,0:18:43.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Well said!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:45.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Bring wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.51,0:18:55.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yunchang, have this hot wine to embolden you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.54,0:19:03.60,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Hold onto it! I will be back in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:21.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.333,497.333)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:35.16,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.89,0:20:25.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The wine is still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:27.32,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.73,0:20:41.56,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,My brother's killed Hua Xiong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:45.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Why aren't we now breaking through\N the pass to capture Dong Zhuo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:46.23,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.23,0:20:47.01,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:48.66,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,We nobles have been most modest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.93,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,yet you, a petty grunt for a magistrate, dare grandstand here!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.93,0:20:53.90,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Guards! Expel them from the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Victors should be rewarded despite rank!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:21:00.90,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,If you lot hold a county prefect to such honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.03,0:21:03.88,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,then I shall take my leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:11.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.68,0:21:17.01,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why let a mere quarrel impede our mission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.01,0:21:17.94,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.64,0:21:36.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(392,352)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1890,2240)}Lǐ Rú
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:37.76,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Premier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.09,0:21:42.86,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Hua Xiong was just slain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:46.39,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,The enemies are strengthening with each day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.79,0:21:48.68,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,We cannot underestimate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.01,0:21:56.12,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Grand Tutor Yuan Wei is the uncle of Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:21:59.88,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,If they plotted together...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.63,0:22:03.72,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,the damage would be considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.68,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I cannot ignore this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:15.14,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Send men to surround Yuan Shao's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.56,0:22:18.00,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Slaughter them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:31.01,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.83,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Dǒng Zhuō, decrepit bastard...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.27,0:22:53.66,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,You will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.40,0:22:56.62,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Li Jue and Guo Si!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:57.65,Default,Li Jue & Guo Si,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.54,0:23:03.42,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Lead 50,000 troops to guard Sishui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.15,0:23:07.56,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Do not engage the enemy, just hold your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.56,0:23:08.36,Default,Li Jue & Guo Si,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:12.21,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Li Ru, Fengxian, Fan Chou, and Zhang Ji!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.21,0:23:21.95,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Follow me to Hulao Pass with\N 150,000 troops to resist the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.95,0:23:22.75,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:24.14,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Qiao Mao!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.02,Default,Qiao Mao,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.03,0:23:25.68,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Bao Xin!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.68,0:23:26.57,Default,Bao Xin,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:27.46,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Yuan Yi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:28.40,Default,Yuan Yi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.40,0:23:29.13,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Kong Rong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.13,0:23:30.08,Default,Kong Rong,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:30.84,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Zhang Yang!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:31.52,Default,Zhang Yang,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:32.27,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Tao Qian!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.27,0:23:33.02,Default,Tao Qian,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:34.08,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Gongsun Zan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.08,0:23:34.68,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:37.94,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Your armies will sally as one force!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.94,0:23:39.48,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,We will march to Hulao!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.85,0:23:41.01,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.55,0:23:44.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Mengde will support us from between the passes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.54,0:23:46.31,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.40,0:23:52.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Let us march to Hulao! Let us catch Dong Zhuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:58.84,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Let us march to Hulao! Let us catch Dong Zhuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:52.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(976,368)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3550,4000)}Hǔláo Pass
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.77,0:26:05.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who will engage?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.36,0:26:09.19,Default,Fang Yue,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.87,0:26:10.76,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.23,0:26:14.32,Default,Wang Kuang,0,0,0,,The famed Fang Yue of Henei.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.63,0:26:46.50,Default,Mu Shun,0,0,0,,Lü Bu, on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.66,0:26:50.40,Default,Zhang Yang,0,0,0,,That's my subordinate, Mu Shun!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.56,0:27:28.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lü Bu is unequaled in prowess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:31.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,We should call all our allies to devise a proper plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.60,0:27:37.12,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Only by eliminating Lü Bu can we slay Dong Zhuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.47,0:27:38.52,Default,Gongsun Zan,0,0,0,,I'll challenge him!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.22,0:27:59.03,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Bastard of three surnames! I am Zhang Fei of Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:14.88,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Beat the war drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:27.33,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:54.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,My brothers, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:03.58,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Beat the war drum!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.50,0:30:20.37,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.48,0:30:29.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Pursue him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.72,0:30:41.57,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Shut the gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.19,0:30:57.18,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.22,0:31:01.16,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Withdraw!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.84,0:31:12.71,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, this is so fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.50,0:31:17.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.69,0:31:35.68,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Before Hulao Pass, we eight lords \Nfought a major battle with Lü Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.22,0:31:38.01,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,We won, but withdrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.13,0:31:44.24,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Now the leader wants us to march into Sishui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.62,0:31:48.12,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.27,0:31:51.66,Default,Cheng Pu,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:54.03,Default,Cheng Pu,0,0,0,,Two days ago, we lost Zu Mao in a major defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:57.11,Default,Cheng Pu,0,0,0,,With a great loss of manpower, we should not attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.61,0:31:59.65,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.65,0:32:02.31,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,Yuan Shu oversees the supplies of the coalition.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.31,0:32:04.99,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,He envies the capable, so he refused us supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.99,0:32:07.33,Default,Huang Gai,0,0,0,,My lord, why endanger yourself for the Yuans?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:08.01,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:16.36,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Cheng Pu and Han Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.36,0:32:16.93,Default,Cheng Pu & Han Dang,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.93,0:32:19.30,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Follow me to Yuan Shu's camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.30,0:32:20.22,Default,Cheng Pu & Han Dang,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.11,0:32:24.62,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Be careful about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.62,0:32:25.37,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.89,0:32:35.64,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Gonglu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.29,0:32:40.83,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,I had no problem with Dong Zhuo,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.83,0:32:44.92,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,yet I fight him tooth and nail regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.92,0:32:50.80,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,for the sake of ridding the nation of a traitor and for the sake of your clan as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.80,0:32:54.87,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Yet you listen to lies and refused us\N supplies, thus my defeat by Hua Xiong!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.87,0:32:57.68,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,General, how can you be so cavalier?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:08.19,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,It was his idea not to give you provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.19,0:33:10.58,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,General, it was not my idea alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.58,0:33:11.78,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,You dare deny this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.58,0:33:13.06,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.06,0:33:13.56,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.57,0:33:15.77,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Take him out...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.57,0:33:17.21,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.65,0:33:19.41,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Have mercy on me! Have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.40,0:33:24.94,Default,Advisor,0,0,0,,Mercy! Mercy, please, mercy! Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:35.21,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,I made a mistake heeding his advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.13,0:33:39.86,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,I ask that you accept my apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.42,0:33:46.44,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,General Yuan, now that the guilty is punished,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:48.58,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,there is no more strife between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.89,0:33:51.34,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,From now on, let us work as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:53.45,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Do not let anything divide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.45,0:33:55.52,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Wentai, you are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:01.98,Default,Han Dang,0,0,0,,General Sun, someone is requesting your presence at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.67,0:34:04.44,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Fine, I will take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.14,0:34:06.67,Default,Yuan Shu,0,0,0,,Wentai, after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.32,0:34:36.47,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,Li Jue pays his respects to General Sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:37.54,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.83,0:34:40.31,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Why have you come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.31,0:34:42.13,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,The Premier ordered me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.36,0:34:44.91,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Why did Dong Zhuo send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:50.12,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,As the Premier holds you in high esteem, he sent me to propose a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.69,0:34:51.60,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.92,0:35:02.11,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,He has a daughter who he wishes for your son to-
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.11,0:35:02.67,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.85,0:35:11.55,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Dong Zhuo is despicable without equal. He terrorizes the Han court!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.55,0:35:14.49,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,I would slay his clan to the \Nninth degree for the realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.50,0:35:16.28,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,You think I would ally with that traitor!?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.10,0:35:18.10,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,General, that—
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.10,0:35:18.80,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.26,0:35:21.47,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:24.69,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Tell that bastard to give up the pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.40,0:35:26.19,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.69,0:35:30.22,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,If you surrender the pass, I may spare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.22,0:35:32.64,Default,Sun Jian,0,0,0,,Delay any more, and your bones will be ground to a powder!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.07,0:35:34.51,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.96,0:35:51.03,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,Sun Jian was too imprudent! It's not my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.32,0:35:54.79,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.25,0:35:56.39,Default,Li Jue,0,0,0,,Okay okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.63,0:36:15.88,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,The marriage proposal failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.52,0:36:18.10,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What next?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.70,0:36:25.45,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.68,0:36:30.14,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Morale is low with the defeat of Lü Bu.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.98,0:36:34.86,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,We should recall the troops back to Luoyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.86,0:36:36.92,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,then move the capital to Chang'an.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.97,0:36:39.15,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Move the capital?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.15,0:36:41.26,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Correct. Move the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.10,0:36:46.01,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Chang'an is vast and its population is flourishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.01,0:36:48.67,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,It served as the capital for the previous dynasties.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.36,0:36:53.84,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,Moreover, my lord, you've lived there for many years and laid a strong foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.84,0:36:59.86,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,It also has Tong Pass and other natural barriers to put distance between us and those lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.86,0:37:02.52,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,It will be easy to defend from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:09.60,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,My lord, have you not heard\N of this children's folk rhyme?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.04,0:37:11.45,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What children's rhyme?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.29,0:37:17.53,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"A Han in the west", \N"a Han in the east."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.12,0:37:23.94,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"The deer within Cháng'ān \Nwill worry the least."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:27.57,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:35.62,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Hàn Gāozǔ AKA. Liú Bāng, first emperor of the Western Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.29,0:37:33.94,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"A Han in the west" refers to {\bord12}Gaozu making Chang'an in the west the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.94,0:37:35.76,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Reigning for twelve generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.44,0:37:44.84,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Hàn Guāngwǔ AKA. Liú Xiù, first emperor of the Eastern Han
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.58,0:37:41.98,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"A Han in the east" refers to {\bord12}Guangwu making Luoyang in the east the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.98,0:37:44.35,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Reigning also for twelve generations
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.01,0:37:48.00,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Relocation is destined.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:51.22,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Premier, if you move the capital back to Chang'an,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.22,0:37:53.43,Default,Li Ru,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}your worries would disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.16,0:37:59.49,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Had you not clarified, I would never have understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.16,0:38:05.63,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Heaven's will lies in a children's folk rhyme!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.64,0:38:08.81,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.56,0:38:12.14,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,I will recall the troops back to Luoyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.14,0:38:14.44,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,and arrange the relocation of the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.96,0:38:49.92,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.667,396)}Emperor Xiàn of Hàn
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.19,0:38:50.88,Default,Dong Zhuo,0,0,0,,This minister pays his respects to Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.50,0:39:06.29,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.24,0:39:08.78,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why not chase Dong Zhuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.78,0:39:10.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.32,0:39:28.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Benchu, he burned the palace\N and holds the Emperor hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.49,0:39:30.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,His actions have appalled the whole realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.88,0:39:34.64,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The survival of our nation is at stake, \Nhow can we do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:45.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That traitor fears our power,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.59,0:39:48.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,so he moved the capital west to avoid our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.03,0:39:51.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lü Bu was routed at Hulao Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.28,0:39:53.99,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Their morale is low, while ours is high!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.80,0:39:58.28,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,If we fight them now, peace will be restored!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.77,0:40:02.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,How can we miss this pivotal moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.50,0:40:05.65,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,Our soldiers are exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.65,0:40:07.86,Default,Yuan Shao,0,0,0,,To continue fighting would do us no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.10,0:40:11.88,Default,Generals,0,0,0,,Indeed! We cannot act rashly!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.47,0:40:27.97,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Ignorant fools! A waste of time!

